=== JOHNSON DIVIDE /256 — SIMULATION leg (round-10 Job A, 2026-11-23) ===

Purpose: the /256 divide ratio was silicon-confirmed via the cell-identical
CFGMCLK control (divide_ratio_control.log, ratios 5.965/5.953/5.939 -> 256).
This log adds the missing independent leg: the prescaler source
(clock_probe_ctrl.v lines 50-66, copied verbatim into johnson_divide_tb.v)
simulated edge-exactly with iverilog — no host counter window, no wrap
assumptions. Complements, does not replace, the silicon evidence.

Method note: two earlier TB drafts were discarded WITHOUT publication:
(1) fork/wait reader raced the design (all-zero reads);
(2) edges-since-rise counter excluded the detection edge itself (read 255).
Final TB increments before detection (interval = both detection edges
inclusive) in one clocked process with NBA last-cycle semantics;
first observed tick_rise only arms the recorder.

$ iverilog -g2012 -o /tmp/johnson_divide_sim evidence/clock_probe/johnson_divide_tb.v
COMPILE_EXIT=0

